                  <l2 n="ILLines" />
                  <v n="Comment">"
					For each CAC file '..\CAC\Restore' folder, re-build OAC files into '..\OAC' folder and delete CAC file from '..\CAC\Restore' folder
Folder is checked immediately when a file has been restored from the archive or every 4s at all other times
This allows for a CAC file to be place onto CX2020 from elsewhere and the OAC files will be restored
				"</v>
